{
  "id": "E257",
  "title": "National Day Plans",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-09-29",
  "synopsis": "A seven day holiday is coming up, but Lili doesn’t want to go traveling.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/849/26c93367387a1328e032e214d7cffe1ccdac1d66.mp3?1536666453",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "国庆节你准备做什么？\n\n本：丽丽，国庆节你准备做什么？\n丽丽：我准备回家。\n本：你不想去旅游吗？\n丽丽：国庆节旅游的人太多，机票太贵，在家休息更好。",
    "traditional": "國慶節你準備做什麼？\n\n本：麗麗，國慶節你準備做什麼？\n麗麗：我準備回家。\n本：你不想去旅遊嗎？\n麗麗：國慶節旅遊的人太多，機票太貴，在家休息更好。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What are your plans for the National Day?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：丽丽，国庆节你准备做什么？",
      "traditional": "本：麗麗，國慶節你準備做什麼？",
      "pinyin": "běn lì lì guó qìng jié nǐ zhǔn bèi zuò shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lili, what are your plans for the National Day holiday?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我准备回家。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我準備回家。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ zhǔn bèi huí jiā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I plan to go back home."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：你不想去旅游吗？",
      "traditional": "本：你不想去旅遊嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ bù xiǎng qù lǚ yóu ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Don’t you want to go traveling?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：国庆节旅游的人太多，机票太贵，",
      "traditional": "麗麗：國慶節旅遊的人太多，機票太貴，",
      "pinyin": "lì lì guó qìng jié lǚ yóu de rén tài duō jī piào tài guì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "在家休息更好。",
      "traditional": "在家休息更好。",
      "pinyin": "zài jiā xiū xi gèng hǎo",
      "english": "Lili: There are too many people traveling during the National Day holiday, and flight tickets are too expensive."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It’s better to stay at home and rest."
    }
  ],
